"""
Integration tests for the Document Upload + Parsing pipeline.

What we test:
  - Uploading supported file types (TXT, MD, PDF-like bytes)
  - Rejection of unsupported MIME types (415)
  - Rejection of oversized files (413)
  - Idempotent / duplicate upload detection (same content → same document_id)
  - Polling document status endpoint
  - Fetching the section outline after parsing
  - Cross-project isolation (document from project A is not visible in project B)
  - Unauthenticated access is rejected (401 / 403)
  - Document not found in wrong project returns 404

These tests run against a real local SQLite + ChromaDB (not mocked)
so they exercise the full pipeline end-to-end.
The OpenAI embeddings call IS made during parse — set OPENAI_API_KEY in your .env.
If you want to run without hitting OpenAI, see conftest.py for mock options.
"""

